chedule\nView Davidson County Early Voting Schedule for the November 3, 2026 General Election\nClick Here\nCheck Your Voter Registration\nCheck Your Voter Registration\nCheck Your Voter Registration\nView your voter registration profile to see your jurisdictions, polling places, and a sample ballot (when available)\nClick Here\nCheck Your Polling Place\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement\nCheck Your Voter Registration\nView your Polling Place Location for the November 3, 2026 General Election\nClick Here\nApply to be a Poll Worker\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement\nClick here to apply to apply to be a Poll Worker in Davidson County. Be a Democracy Hero!\nClick Here\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement\nNC Voter Photo ID Requirement\nLearn more about North Carolina's Voter Photo ID Requirement\nClick Here\nElection Results\nElection Results\nElection Results\nView election results in North Carolina's official Election Results Dashboard\nClick Here\nelection day 2026\nNovember 3, 2026 General Election\n0\n0\nDays\nDays\n0\n0\nHrs\nHours\n0\n0\nMins\nMinutes\n0\n0\nSecs\nSeconds\nUpcoming Schedule of Events\nUpcoming Schedule of Events\nUpcoming Schedule of Events\nNovember 3, 2026 General Election\nSeptember 4, 2026\n-\nAbsentee by Mail\nballots released\nSeptember 14, 2026\n-\nLogic and Accuracy Testing Begins\nOctober 9, 2026\n-\nVoter Registration\nDeadline for General Elections\nOctober 15, 2026\n-\nEarly Voting\nBegins\nOctober 20, 2026 (5pm)\n-\nAbsentee\nBallot Request Deadline\nOctober 31, 2026 (3pm)\n-\nEarly Voting\nEnds\nNovember 3, 2026\n- Election Day (polls open 6:30am-7:30pm at assigned\npolling location\n)\nContact Us\nUpcoming Schedule of Events\nUpcoming Schedule of Events\nDavidson County Board of Elections\nPhysical Address:\n945 N. Main Street, Suite A\nLexington, NC 27292\nMailing Address:\nPO Box 1084\nLexington, NC 27293\nTelephone:\n(336) 242-2190\nFax:\n(336) 242-2199\nEmail:\nDavidson.boe@david